    "Defense Attributes": "Fire 20, Water 20, Wind 20, Earth 20, Holy 20, Unholy 20",
    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 This great sage is sometimes called Varka Silenos' Hope. He prophesied that the future of Varka Silenos was in the land of Goddard and persuaded Chief Horus to lead Silenos there. Despite age and infirmity, he stood in the front ranks to aid Commander Mos against the powerful Ketra Orcs. Humanoids Lv. 6 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Humanoids. Atk. Spd. +2.5% Accuracy +3 Evasion +2 P. Def. -5% Received Critical Damage +5% Resistance to Bleed -10% HP Increase (1x) Lv. 1 MP Increase (1x) Lv. 1 Average P. Atk. Lv. 11 Average M. Atk. Lv. 11 Average P. Def. Lv. 11 Average M. Def. Lv. 11 Standard Type Lv. 2 Normal P. Def. and Evasion. One-handed Blunt Weapons Lv. 6 Blunt Weapons Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
